@gelius__ Sandkeeper is a cozy sand art game. Here, the beach at Dieppe goes into a kite-shaped bottle in four colors of sand: one of 48 places in your grandfather's book.
Wishlist it on Steam. It comes out March 9, with a demo in Steam Next Fest in February:
